  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "num": "01",
      "en": "The {memorial} to John Todd's environmental legacy lies in his revolutionary eco-machines.When John Todd was a child, he loved to explore the {woods} around his house, {observing} how nature solved problems.A {dirty stream} , for example, often became clear after {flowing} through {plants} and along rocks where {tiny creatures} lived.This is where his journey began as a {tale} of scientific exploration.When he got older, John started to wonder if this process could be used to clean up the {messes} people were making.",
      "cn": "约翰·托德在环境方面留下功绩的 纪念 体现在他那些具有革命性的生态机器上。在约翰·托德还是个孩子的时候，他就喜欢探索家附近的 树林 ， 观察 大自然是如何解决问题的。例如，一条 污浊的溪流 在 流 经 植物 和 微小生物 栖息的岩石后，往往会变得清澈起来。这就是他科学探险 故事 开始的地方。随着年龄的增长，约翰开始思考这个过程是否可以用来清理人们制造的（环境） 乱象 。"
    },
    {
      "num": "02",
      "en": "After studying {agriculture} , {medicine} , and {fisheries} in college, John came to the {entrance} of the new field of ecological engineering.He went back to observing nature and asking questions.Why can certain plants trap {harmful} bacteria ( (细菌) )? Which kinds of {fish} can eat cancer-causing {chemicals} ? With the right combination of {animals} and plants, he figured, maybe he could clean up waste the way nature did.He decided to build what he would later call an eco-machine.",
      "cn": "在大学学习了 农业 、 医学 和 渔业 后，约翰进入了生态工程这一新兴领域的 大门 。他重新开始观察自然，并提出问题。为什么某些植物能捕获 有害 细菌？哪种 鱼 能吃掉致癌 化学物质 ？他想，通过 动物 和植物的正确组合，也许他就能像大自然那样净化废物了。他决定制造一种他后来称之为“生态机器”的东西。"
    },
    {
      "num": "03",
      "en": "The task John set for {himself} was to remove harmful {substances} from some sludge ( (污泥) ).First, he {constructed} a simple {format} for organizing a series of clear fiberglass ( (玻璃纤维) ) {tanks} connected to each other.Each tank served as a mini-ecosystem, a {vehicle} for nature's own purification processes.Then he went around to local {ponds} and streams and {brought} back some plants and animals.He placed them in the tanks and waited.Little by little, these different kinds of life got {used} to one another and formed their own {ecosystem} .Much like a {symphony} , these {organisms} interact in harmony.After a few weeks, John added the sludge.",
      "cn": "约翰为 他自己 设定的任务是从一些污泥中去除有害 物质 。首先，他 构建 了一个简单的 框架 ，用于组织一系列相互连接的透明玻璃纤维 水箱 。每个水箱都充当一个小型生态系统，是大自然自身净化过程的 媒介 。然后，他前往当地的 池塘 和溪流周边， 带回 了一些动植物，把它们放进水箱里，然后等待。渐渐地，这些不同种类的生物开始相互 适应 ，形成了自己的 生态系统 。这些生物就像一部 交响乐 ，和谐地互动着。几周后，约翰把污泥加了进去。"
    },
    {
      "num": "04",
      "en": "He was {amazed} at the results.The plants and animals in the eco-machine took the sludge as food and began to eat it! These living filters work tirelessly to clean the water, requiring minimal human {intervention} .Within weeks, the sludge had all been {digested} , and all that was left was {pure water} .Since then, he has had {faith} in nature's ability to heal when provided with the right tools.",
      "cn": "结果令他感到 惊讶 。生态机器中的动植物把污泥当作食物，开始吞食它！这些有生命的过滤器不知疲倦地净化着水，几乎不需要人工 干预 。几周内，污泥就被全部 消化 了，只剩下 纯净的水 。从那以后，他就 坚信 ，只要提供了合适的工具，大自然就有自我修复的能力。"
    },
    {
      "num": "05",
      "en": "Over the years John has taken on many big jobs.He developed a greenhouse-like {facility} that treated sewage ( (污水) ) from 1,600 homes in the South.He also designed a {patent} eco-machine to clean {canal} water in Fuzhou, a city in {southeast China} .",
      "cn": "多年来，约翰承担了许多重大工作。他开发了一个类似温室的 设施 ，用于处理南方1600户家庭的污水。他还设计了一种 专利 生态机器，用于清洁 中国东南部 城市福州的 运河 水。"
    },
    {
      "num": "06",
      "en": "As we face increasing water challenges in the 21st century, John's eco-machines stand as a testament to the healing power of nature, proving that the answers we seek may already be {beneath} our feet.“ {Ecological} design” is the name John gives to what he does.“Life on {Earth} is like a {box} of spare parts for the {inventor} ,”he says.“You put organisms in new relationships and observe what happens.”",
      "cn": "在21世纪，当我们面临着日益严峻的水资源挑战时，约翰的生态机器就是大自然治愈力量的见证，表明我们寻求的答案可能早已在我们脚 下 。约翰将自己所做的工作称为“ 生态 设计”。他说：“ 地球 上的生命就像 发明家 手中的一 盒 备用零件。你将 生物 置于新的关系之中，然后观察会发生什么。” 5NoOncib/NjiX02BpMIzP4m+378Hw1xTRxUdPaP/PFjKUFq4K2G7tp6ZLYoCE601yW1W39VMdLmovFdSHs4nVQ=="
    }
  ],
